    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.48.0"&gt;3.48.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Add support for IBMMQ 10.x.x&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Client side stats] Fix incorrect statistic generation introduced in 3.43.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for IBM MQ 10.x.x (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4751874617" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8835" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8835/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8835"&gt;#8835&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix ObjectDisposedException race in DataStreamsWriter disposal (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4597051328" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8758" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8758/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8758"&gt;#8758&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Avoid oversized coverage IPC messages (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4745068665" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8832" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8832/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8832"&gt;#8832&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Debugger&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Guard static member capture (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4717816621" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8814" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8814/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8814"&gt;#8814&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Avoid resolving call tokens in exception replay IL scan (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4718360192" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8815" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8815/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8815"&gt;#8815&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove sampling-based weighting in Client Side Stats (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4741867638" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8828" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8828/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8828"&gt;#8828&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build / Test&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update to use dd-sts instead of long-lived credentials (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4702304741" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8809" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8809/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8809"&gt;#8809&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Package Versions Bump] Updating package versions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4708892121" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8810" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8810/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8810"&gt;#8810&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix GitHub Actions bugs and update documentation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4715967585" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8812" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8812/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8812"&gt;#8812&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI] Add net10.0 to AWS Lambda test runtimes (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4728092445" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8819" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8819/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8819"&gt;#8819&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/compare/v3.47.0...v3.48.0"&gt;Changes since 3.47.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
